# Front-end OPTIONS / AUDIO / VIDEO screens (pak flow; w28r, written with script_probe --text).
# Title ~3 s; 4 START -> START GAME menu (START GAME, PLAYERS, RECORDS, OPTIONS, AUDIO, VIDEO); DOWN x2 + A ->
# OPTIONS (PLAYER ARROWS, TRACK MAP, RADAR, TIME ELAPSED/REMAINING, TACHOMETER, SPEEDOMETER, ODOMETER, PLACE, GEARSHIFT,
# METRIC, WRONG WAY, COINS): RIGHT/LEFT on every row; B; DOWN + A -> AUDIO (EFFECTS/MUSIC VOLUME, MUSIC TRACK, DEFAULTS,
# SPEAKERS): every row changed, A on DEFAULTS; B; DOWN + A -> VIDEO (VERTICAL/HORIZONTAL CENTER, RESET TO DEFAULTS).
# Reaches the menu-block row/value renderers (func_8010A7A4, func_8010A8D0, func_8010AEAC, func_8010E8B4, func_8010EA08,
# func_8010F218) and the option-screen handlers (func_800DA0BC, func_800DA2C0, func_800DB1E0, replay_save_prompt,
# game_results_update, particle_collision/particle_render: historical labels).
